  <item>
    <title>Vol.52 爱你的心是蓝色的💙</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ae5f5cdc96c8942ec15381c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ae5f5cdc96c8942ec15381c</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 14:10:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 恩野的十月得了严重的湿疹</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">01:40</a> 叶开的十月好像有点太丰富了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="111">01:51</a> 活动目录：香港大学大学堂导赏、湾仔锡克庙导赏、大坑舞火龙制香工作坊、活字印刷厂导赏、初阶活字印刷工作坊、腊味工厂导赏、中电钟楼文化馆导赏</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="361">06:01</a> 腊味工厂导赏，了解腊肠的制作工序</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="987">16:27</a> 叶开寄给恩野的润肠让她想起了童年的味道</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1171">19:31</a> 活字印刷厂导赏，介绍活字印刷知识</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1669">27:49</a> 活字印刷工作坊，印一份自己的卡片</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2372">39:32</a> 叶开印的是加缪的那句“在我身上有一个不可战胜的夏天”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2474">41:14</a> 这个月我们都看了电影《蓝宇》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2492">41:32</a> 后劲很大，让叶开想起那句“电影是以余味定输赢”（有少许剧透）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2875">47:55</a> 高先电影院重映，叶开还见到了关锦鹏导演，听了映后谈</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2932">48:52</a> 我们都到了看懂《蓝宇》的年纪了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3006">50:06</a> 最触动恩野和叶开的情节（剧透预警）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3308">55:08</a> “这就是你独立的一面啊”</span></p><p><span>————————</span></p><p></p><p><span>香港大学大学堂</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuJ9zwGkoD4iJ0yrPG81x0N-H1lO.jpg"></figure><p></p><p><span>湾仔锡克庙</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlQxrbgJPkY7qpr_cJKZry8x4JLX.jpg"></figure><p></p><p><span>制香工作坊</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtlXp4ugF5GHIhjm34lNo3Eq1ZSl.jpg"></figure><p></p><p><span>中电钟楼文化馆</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsUhg0asx8wka0svL4e-8agEMStT.jpg"></figure><p></p><p><span>裕和腊味厂房</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsO1J-HBNYqEQyuVlgO7hKlkJ5c3.jpg"></figure><p></p><p><span>活字制作过程：</span></p><p><span>字粒盘和猫纸</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlQupskKGXKLTKborzVd9czwr8dd.jpg"></figure><p></p><p><span>排版</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsjt_oC75SLU_4Z3AGhrhdc7qkeL.jpg"></figure><p></p><p><span>印刷机</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjpmt1p3uKUwBsFWoru4ptwDZ8x1.jpg"></figure><p></p><p><span>埋版</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjky26B1RwfB54doEckQiS3kiEow.jpg"></figure><p></p><p><span>成品</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqybpkUnfz5AO-qZvWpvJY0m8FcY.jpg"></figure><p></p><p><span>在电影院看到蓝宇的幸福</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhsvfCSm-utjf9mzLdjO5S1PiOnO.jpg"></figure><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/62ca620653bb1ec4bdfa9a68/lta2e_5_2hYHb16sSiraRg4C1Suu.m4a" length="55399640" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:57:05</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv1e7y3gF_R4UdECElHekwV4x24A.jpg"/>
