  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.51 那些过去了的就过去了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6abd270de742e36efcbd42fa</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6abd270de742e36efcbd42fa</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 15:16:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="24">00:24</a> 九月，恩野又开始去游泳了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="116">01:56</a> 恩野拼图拼积木会停不下来</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="263">04:23</a> 买了自己的台球杆</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="364">06:04</a> 从拼图这件事上就可以看出两人性格的不同</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="698">11:38</a> 还去和朋友吃海鲜，做手工</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="786">13:06</a> 将近一年来恩野带爸爸看病的经历</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1155">19:15</a> 给大家的建议是尽早给父母买保险</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2136">35:36</a> 最大的感受就是只能屏蔽情绪去做事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2481">41:21</a> 火年火月让叶开感觉像变了一个人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2663">44:23</a> 叶开去红馆听了谭咏麟的演唱会，很感动</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3048">50:48</a> 去了地铁展和石澳</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/62ca620653bb1ec4bdfa9a68/lqTFvmhjZKptvMAGqYn7OhbRwYWV.m4a" length="51610974" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:53:11</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv1e7y3gF_R4UdECElHekwV4x24A.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.50 是不是因为那里有美丽的那拉提</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a940087a0210c197dca7b07</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a940087a0210c197dca7b07</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 10:12:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>八月，叶开去了新疆！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="38">00:38</a> 叶开的旅行计划总是临时起意</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="88">01:28</a> 八天七晚的行程：乌鲁木齐→赛里木湖→伊昭公路→夏塔→喀拉峻→那拉提→唐布拉→独库公路→乌鲁木齐</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="255">04:15</a> 每天车程长达四至六小时</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="433">07:13</a> 超幸运这次刚好只有我们两个人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="623">10:23</a> 最适合去伊犁的季节其实是</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="777">12:57</a> 新疆的风景给人一种“戊土”的感觉</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="929">15:29</a> 叶开总是一次又一次地爱上骑马</span></p><p><span>在喀拉峻草原骑马 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="967">16:07</a></span></p><p><span>在那拉提草原骑马 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1629">27:09</a></span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3262">54:22</a> 赛里木湖的水像蓝宝石一样蓝</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3300">55:00</a> 在独库公路最高处吃牧民烤的羊肉串</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3479">57:59</a> 在乌鲁木齐大巴扎看人们跳广场舞</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3549">59:09</a> 对比内蒙呼伦贝尔和新疆伊犁</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3714">61:54</a> 叶开认为新疆有几大不能去</span></p><p><span>————————————</span></p><p><span>照片不能照出亲眼所见的万分之一</span></p><p><span>喀拉峻草原 ↓</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmlW53VKcWGXhCkHOi_ckwyCyEbm.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq59MJrLYtMN5HGtZqPCpb1I8hhC.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrxLBjT8feqqCIyWNzal5VFuxgWf.jpg"><p></p><p><span>那拉提草原 ↓</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqV09dnLosgpBTLR-PmgxVTjj0o5.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtG5_bNYj4mZp-TFfzz309UdLJ2k.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnNuWFD44aLFX61bQE5MQAAgLoh2.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlJ3ytRFObsIPfxpZLiyhdFUEHDf.jpg"><p></p><p><span>独库公路山顶烤羊肉 ↓</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhRLXmlZ5v-Yi7KYdGaNPU49LTGq.jpg"><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/62ca620653bb1ec4bdfa9a68/lrUqqB3ytnJn-xGYL10Lu1Rsjqgh.m4a" length="63543243" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:05:29</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv1e7y3gF_R4UdECElHekwV4x24A.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.49 播客四周年 | 没有人听的播客，还要继续录下去吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a65dae6a3fec224d5a38955</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a65dae6a3fec224d5a38955</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 26 Jul 2026 10:03:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 万一这期有人听，请给我们提提意见吧</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">04:20</a> 对于恩野来说，这个播客只要存在在那里就可以了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="491">08:11</a> 这些声音是我们人生很宝贵的记录</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="581">09:41</a> 叶开觉得没有任何反馈会很难坚持</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="734">12:14</a> 前景是迷茫的，生活是要继续的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="787">13:07</a> 叶开的七月，深受情绪控制，心态上很起伏</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="880">14:40</a> 又是一年一度的香港书展</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="964">16:04</a> 在书展听了两场讲座</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1034">17:14</a> 偶遇香港文学馆的湾仔文学散步导赏活动</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1501">25:01</a> 恩野七月完成了一次搬家！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1671">27:51</a> 上周又去佛山吃吃吃，推荐强记粥城，鸿协成饭店</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1945">32:25</a> 最近恩野开始开车上高速了</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/62ca620653bb1ec4bdfa9a68/lozaflMctAO5aqDZAbac0NynSYr-.m4a" length="34744111" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:35:48</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv1e7y3gF_R4UdECElHekwV4x24A.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.48 既然他们能活下去，我也能</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a195a727460cabdeb57d94f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a195a727460cabdeb57d94f</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 29 May 2026 09:26:28 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 恩野的五月</span></p><p><span>五一假期是打麻将、剧本杀 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="37">00:37</a></span></p><p><span>专门为了吃一家店开车去佛山 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="356">05:56</a></span></p><p><span>和朋友去游泳 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="519">08:39</a></span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="746">12:26</a> 叶开的五月</span></p><p><span>五一带老公回韶关外婆家 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="746">12:26</a></span></p><p><span>去黄大仙拜财神 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="962">16:02</a></span></p><p><span>休息时就是在看书 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a></span></p><p><span>在旺角探书店 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1301">21:41</a></span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1437">23:57</a> 恩野五月看了一部电影《面子》（剧透预警）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1862">31:02</a> 叶开五月也有看电影《咖喱辣椒》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1944">32:24</a> 学会一门语言就是打开一个新的世界</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2032">33:52</a> 没办法，真的很喜欢香港</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2214">36:54</a> 原来‘火’年是这种体感</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/62ca620653bb1ec4bdfa9a68/lq17ZNc8w-6e0SDSo9L9BUfEvUUm.m4a" length="40678090" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:41:55</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv1e7y3gF_R4UdECElHekwV4x24A.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.47 四月旅人：台湾纪行</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69f03a6eb973c3fd5996dd54</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69f03a6eb973c3fd5996dd54</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 28 Apr 2026 05:04:46 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 恩野最近谈恋爱谈到上班打瞌睡</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="87">01:27</a> 四月，叶开去台湾玩了！</span></p><p><span>行程：高雄、台南、台北</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="183">03:03</a> 在台南，叶开看了两个展，听了三场导赏</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="212">03:32</a> 展览：台湾文学馆、司法博物馆</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="561">09:21</a> 导赏：赤崁楼、孔庙、司法博物馆猫道</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="859">14:19</a> 在林百货买到喜欢的帆布袋和零钱袋</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1107">18:27</a> 办理电话卡的见闻</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1338">22:18</a> 在台南最需要的是：一部机车！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1459">24:19</a> 台铁和高铁的不同</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1518">25:18</a> 在台北，主要行程是逛书店（这一段有一分半的静音，请大家自行脑补我的感受吧～）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1716">28:36</a> 漫游台大</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1987">33:07</a> 台北101、四四南村、台北故宫</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2137">35:37</a> 虾皮Shopee购物体验</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2248">37:28</a> 其实叶开是想在虾皮上买……？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2484">41:24</a> 台北公车站的设计</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2685">44:45</a> 这次旅行，叶开又对自己有了新的认知：原来我是为了让自己舒服而不遗余力的人</span></p><p><span>因为工程噪音提出换房间 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2744">45:44</a></span></p><p><span>为了不被吹风在公车上连换三次位子 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2993">49:53</a></span></p><p><span>有时候情绪不好是因为身体有什么地方不舒服 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3074">51:14</a></span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3275">54:35</a> 让自己舒服是需要培养的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3395">56:35</a> 恩野提问叶开：香港和台湾给叶开的不同感受</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4022">67:02</a> 不得不提的是，四月我们还见面了！一起吃海鲜</span></p><p><span>————————————</span></p><p><span>注意，你已被文学包围</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiW8mTmUZPZJY6JXvhD1u5dZ9FiM.jpg"></figure><p><span>展览交互性之一：随处可见的小设计</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuOA9U2B-UFyqTIGSxeZOPMTLY0F.jpg"></figure><p><span>展览交互性之二：抽签抽到文学签诗</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrAQ4OK0EFBUauiD7_mf7JBfrO4q.jpg"></figure><p><span>展览交互性之三：大法官解签</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpBEAFV8oubhBDxaYVYRpG1_Gzex.jpg"></figure><p><span>展览交互性之四：再怎么简陋的设备也搞点交互出来</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FplfPM091FdhXsDLjFk5iuvv4pqG.jpg"></figure><p><span>文学馆还有台语版的宣传册</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo6RnJb5vipjs9FSeroamzsg6V6M.jpg"></figure><p><span>台南林百货</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvOXP1mK7uVdBdz0Z0DdLlwljvpy.jpg"></figure><p><span>在林百货买到的好东西：台南百年布庄锦源兴</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqgQ5QDVgJCLbw3TJK5-vf4sdYhD.jpg"></figure><p><span>台南散步之全美戏院门口见到李安导演</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu-WMZeYy0XQRLmm3G2DCYJeHujB.jpg"></figure><p><span>司法博物馆猫道参观证</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FubbZlkjLZlLHVXEEBcG9ZRzr6qj.jpg"></figure><p><span>拼台湾地图悠游卡（是五张可以正常使用的交通卡）</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjxBsCzncQqoUduOxCjOyzyAI-J9.jpg"></figure><p><span>台大化学工程馆的风格</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgpayvhHjdiOCsAG9ij4xWE3dJpU.jpg"></figure><p><span>而这是台大文学院的风格</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlDM6nRxtOHMeRWvITXcLtPBlXvB.jpg"></figure><p><span>文学院正门入口也太美了</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FopJNSBzsosc5X8kTm2DdRWP7AdD.jpg"></figure><p><span>审美积累之台北酒店吃早餐的空间（朝东，早晨正好阳光照树影）</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsWPLcbuA062yZxO2UNpo8UTQHBb.jpg"></figure><p><span>换到的酒店房间窗外绿意盎然</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr5o7uMesoewEd1-iEoevySz9tVv.jpg"></figure><p><span>机场快线外的士车道看到的浪漫（车道全长两百米的一段文字）</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrGYwzgnCq_mKFa3bHtycrHi7VKC.jpg"></figure><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/62ca620653bb1ec4bdfa9a68/llGZD31OGSzKbMSXhbREvlLG6pCv.m4a" length="65959890" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:07:58</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv1e7y3gF_R4UdECElHekwV4x24A.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
