  <item>
    <title>Vol.46 在我一生的黄金时代</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69c8a904b977fb2c477f0fe8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69c8a904b977fb2c477f0fe8</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 29 Mar 2026 04:36:18 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 恩野的三月被恋爱的粉色泡泡包围</span><br><span>在恋爱中发现自己未知的一面 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="22">00:22</a> </span><br><span>三月去了很多不同的公园 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="99">01:39</a></span><br><span>看了两部电影，买了投影仪 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="155">02:35</a> </span><br><span>去肇庆逛公园，吃好吃的 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="229">03:49</a></span><br><span>恩野选择忠于当下的生活 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="327">05:27</a> &nbsp;</span><br><span>“我必须找回我自己，你们也是” <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="565">09:25</a></span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1054">17:34</a> 叶开的三月是生发的、充满活力的 </span><br><span>“黑暗中对话”体验 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1114">18:34</a> </span><br><span>了解东涌少数族裔生活 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1787">29:47</a> </span><br><span>叶开性格中一直有“探险者”的部分 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2312">38:32</a> </span><br><span>闲逛元朗天水围和香港湿地公园 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2474">41:14</a> </span><br><span>工作之余和同事去打匹克球 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2857">47:37</a> </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3049">50:49</a> “在我一生的黄金时代，我想爱，想吃，还想在一瞬间变成天上半明半暗的云”</span></p><span></span><p><span>————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>肇庆七星岩赏花</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp34PqyiKNvGn82gmbiw7c_yrEEJ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>肇庆竹篙粉</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsYVv0n8Smj4kxuv4l4rj8MxNn9t.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>十八斤超大发财猪手粽（吃过必发）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvTcnoBE1nYthlWNLB2abTiXN45G.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>香港马路边常见的辅助设施</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlHxqfWtKCCMBraM8WmpT3s-hckX.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>常见的清真（HALAL）标志</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmBJIRW0ZozFEcd-SygqL8zMeRe-.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>轻铁和单车道的组合很有日式风格</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjdid-1ZJe1yekHL4B6u34anVFDQ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>湿地公园观鸟屋配备可变焦望远镜</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqzUo__hw7GMCFJ6Bo-j3mODvuR3.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>还有一些播客没讲到的：</span></p><span></span><p><span>参观油麻地警署竟看到方中sir证件，怀念他</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlASuwg-P1xaGLCetv5t_u940y-F.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>探访深井烧鹅之深井村</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh1ZBs41HceED-iDd8cj6rNfaTlg.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>漫步屯门公园</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsybKS1g0Yc4SBFQGM_iJs9a7RNF.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/62ca620653bb1ec4bdfa9a68/llcJwPAv5wZObpYhw2ThX1NhRoli.m4a" length="56772639" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:58:30</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv1e7y3gF_R4UdECElHekwV4x24A.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.45 在星空另一端，思念从未停止，如同墓碑上的名字</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69a058a1a22480add63706b1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69a058a1a22480add63706b1</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 26 Feb 2026 14:35:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>不要哭我最亲爱的人</span><br><span>我最好的玩伴</span><br><span>时空是个圆圈</span><br><span>直行或是转弯</span><br><span>我们最终都会相见</span><br><span>——《我记得》赵雷</span></p><p><span>————————————</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 恩野的外婆去世了，但根据潮汕习俗，“我是没有必要出现的”</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="375">06:15</a> 外婆这一辈子没有让别人照顾过一天，也没有为自己活过一天</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="582">09:42</a> “看着她的时候就会想起我妈妈”</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="944">15:44</a> 好想再见到她，但是再也见不到她了，这种离别对恩野来说还是第一次</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1316">21:56</a> 但是过年还是有好事：恩野谈上新的恋爱了！烟花下的表白</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1607">26:47</a> 她和男友有很像的笑点</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1728">28:48</a> 恩野和叶开聊聊恋爱经验</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1992">33:12</a> 叶开过年跟老公回了梅州老家：聊聊老屋，客家菜和大家庭</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2374">39:34</a> 这次过年感觉收到很多很多的照顾和关爱 </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2629">43:49</a> 客家过年习俗</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2812">46:52</a> 叶开还去了福建土楼，天气很好，很愉快</span></p><p><span>————————————</span></p><p><span>家门口即可看烟花</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmB2MybMTQzN77Y_EoN3_P04Hexl.jpg"></figure><p><span>每餐至少要准备12副碗筷</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtEtu2A-KT5iG4jZWU5kFyJEx3Tv.jpg"></figure><p><span>在土楼买到美丽的冰箱贴</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FveDZDJyojWM-PEk-lSetsy5uw2f.jpg"></figure><p><span>从山上远眺冰箱贴上画的土楼</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpMNGsHxuST9pSyHkAqA0ZRUD5ba.jpg"></figure><p><span>醒狮：新的一年还是祝大家身体健康！</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjD_0jhSETsi_YxIg8weMWpgqTqJ.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/62ca620653bb1ec4bdfa9a68/lmPtoKYxU6x1mOGqWGHg6jendHnL.m4a" length="49391315" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:50:54</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv1e7y3gF_R4UdECElHekwV4x24A.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.44 灵魂真正的渴望是不能忽略的</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/697b5ab7073030367a5bd795</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">697b5ab7073030367a5bd795</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 29 Jan 2026 13:07:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 今年这个年过得太晚</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="153">02:33</a> 一月恩野看了一部纪录片《重返狼群》（剧透预警）</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="610">10:10</a> 一月叶开上班非常忙</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="676">11:16</a> 今天叶开突然感受到了灵魂的渴望</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="895">14:55</a> 叶开明确知道自己想要的不是按部就班的生活</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1110">18:30</a> 感受到自己真正的渴望，会感觉到血液在沸腾</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 叶开第一次认清自己原来是这样的人</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1568">26:08</a> 叶开最近在重温央视94版《三国演义》</span></p><span></span><p><span>————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>甘露寺贾华两面不是人</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjD5S036spsshtE1kcQ4UCZ1aeDz.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>《子夜四时歌》我愿循环播放</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpngN6URKvrmU0Z4texV7JKovffA.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>让我们恭喜这对新人</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fvi-lhfscGDgulZ2JONaSkWK1lDK.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>导演是懂镜头切换的</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqxIUAPltRDZ1wQrA_GecptZ96D5.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>早期情意绵绵剑珍贵影像</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs9VmYy8UHCDITm37QoJb7A9V6QC.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/62ca620653bb1ec4bdfa9a68/ljbEZbgKGXBVRCR9u6JulgeoEGEI.m4a" length="27292170" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:28:07</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv1e7y3gF_R4UdECElHekwV4x24A.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.43 允许自己轻松地生活</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69512c872db086f89768e06d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69512c872db086f89768e06d</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 28 Dec 2025 17:56:35 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2025年十二月，我们又见面了！录制于12月28日，坐标香港。</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="104">01:44</a> 恩野昨天去打了一场羽毛球</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="318">05:18</a> 叶开发现这个世界的规律就是：只要积累，必有收获</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="523">08:43</a> 恩野2026年的目标是去跑一场半马</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="609">10:09</a> 恩野今年谈恋爱最大的收获是看了很多电影</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="691">11:31</a> 叶开今年也看了不少电影，感受到“好电影还是要去电影院看啊”</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="760">12:40</a> 叶开问老公2026年有什么展望</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="836">13:56</a> 叶开是一个不会勉强自己的人</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1039">17:19</a> 恩野所定义的“逃避困难”是逃避那些尚未解决的问题</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1219">20:19</a> 叶开的人生主旨就是轻松</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1362">22:42</a> 所以叶开现在还是一个很普通的人</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1509">25:09</a> 就算放手，世界也不会崩塌的，生活会接住你的</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1604">26:44</a> 恩野没有主动追求过变化，但也从来没有逃避过困难</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1815">30:15</a> 恩野总是在以爱为动力做事情</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1973">32:53</a> 恩野对2026年的展望：期待新的生活</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2063">34:23</a> 不敢放手，是因为不能允许别人做得不够好，本质上是不能允许自己做得不够好</span></p><span></span><p><span>————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>圣诞这几天我看到的香港：</span></p><span></span><p><span>金巴利道</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlaeN6wZeX_5oyTXf8lP54F22u5K.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>旺角道</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgyI5A25hyKwqvd71zCXh11QGMCO.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>新填地街</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg885HqIAppGXo-Q_C14awvvnc0y.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>我喜歡～九龍公園游泳池～</span></p><span></span><p><span>那裏我不再執著一些往事～</span></p><span></span><p><span>（干涸版）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FljCXpPZM_ZmZTqX-OO1kGTLE1wW.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>今年西九的圣诞树好像没有去年大</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frwic7KtV3MEPolroeTiugXMb_oU.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>上海街</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuwNgtFE4yMRFHZA6auOTijBPocP.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>星际城市的店闸门</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgqUHojn_GHi33cxcqQK96HYBug4.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>加拿分道的纪念品店</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnzyglhIPGeY98UDVCvtJV8YVvvc.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/62ca620653bb1ec4bdfa9a68/lr7K5AQCJPRzyV9mqTF2EU-89wmg.m4a" length="37931446" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:39:05</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv1e7y3gF_R4UdECElHekwV4x24A.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.42 越往后的日子，我们会越能活得像自己</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69267a01f8a9e1d16277e7a8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69267a01f8a9e1d16277e7a8</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 26 Nov 2025 04:15:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 播客已经成为我们的生活大事记</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="87">01:27</a> 恩野的十一月</span><br><span>记一次和亲哥的聊天 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="87">01:27</a></span><br><span>婚礼是一场家人朋友间的盛大聚会 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="231">03:51</a></span><br><span>叶开是一个饿和累的时候会臭脸的人 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="372">06:12</a></span><br><span>去清远和漳州参加两场婚礼吃到的美食 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="656">10:56</a></span><br><span>没有得到过爱的人就不会相信爱 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="805">13:25</a></span><br><span>希望姐姐结婚生子后也能有自己的时间 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1058">17:38</a></span><br><span>阅读《明亮的夜晚》的感受 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1148">19:08</a></span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1532">25:32</a> 怎么现在感恩日记一个点都写不出来</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1629">27:09</a> 恩野问叶开：你和谁呆在一起有很舒服的感觉？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1762">29:22</a> 关于漳州，泉州和潮汕</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2000">33:20</a> 叶开的十一月</span><br><span>十一月好像总是和医有缘 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2000">33:20</a></span><br><span>生日那天去了香港海洋公园 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2053">34:13</a></span><br><span>这个月又开始学语言了 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2378">39:38</a></span><br><span>学英语的经验 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2585">43:05</a></span><br><span>语言是叶开的天赋所在 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2846">47:26</a></span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2942">49:02</a> 叶开感觉到摆脱“好学生思维”的重要性</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3608">60:08</a> 恩野说，可能等我们年纪更大些，应对就会更自如，因为做自己的经验越来越多了</span></p><span></span><p><span>————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>好吃的漳州卤面</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg2O9lICKHz7SyZrH33Vo7rf3dDO.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>还有一些好吃的炸物</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fvjze8oYDXZCPbBf0G5hXnTCwPgM.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>香港海洋公园的海景缆车</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtDV5PQ2SYzUMR9tNHFkzGELy2no.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>关于我心中的落日飞车</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiIPeWOfeAEvPsbvUnoX6qfnh1Y_.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/62ca620653bb1ec4bdfa9a68/lkiHZI1A1gs5qk2nnxkLFw0IixfW.m4a" length="63400963" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:05:20</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv1e7y3gF_R4UdECElHekwV4x24A.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.41 温柔地走进那个良夜！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6901da5f740634ca4796d2d0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6901da5f740634ca4796d2d0</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 29 Oct 2025 09:43:28 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 十月重磅消息：叶开结婚了！</span><br><span>恩野问了叶开一些问题：</span><br><span>结婚的主要理由？<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="114">01:54</a></span><br><span>是谁先做的这个决定？<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="243">04:03</a></span><br><span>结婚前后心态上有什么变化？<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="533">08:53</a></span><br><span>领证那天有什么仪式？<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="697">11:37</a></span><br><span>叶开这个婚结得实在太低调 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="858">14:18</a></span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1071">17:51</a> 十月，恩野去了一趟汕头</span><br><span>使灵魂升华的猪血汤 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1071">17:51</a></span><br><span>在汕头的街头闲坐、发呆 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1249">20:49</a></span><br><span>关于潮汕话的讨论 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1371">22:51</a></span><br><span>记错时间看脱口秀迟到一小时 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1453">24:13</a></span><br><span>生活习惯上的差异 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1536">25:36</a></span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1657">27:37</a> 聊聊《罗小黑战记》（严重剧透，未看过但想看请不要听，如果不感兴趣不会看可以听）</span><br><span>叶开为什么很喜欢鹿野和无限 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1708">28:28</a></span><br><span>恩野为什么很喜欢大电影1 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1937">32:17</a></span><br><span>罗小黑电影情节的张弛有度 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2120">35:20</a></span><br><span>罗小黑TV第40集令叶开应激了 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2352">39:12</a></span><br><span>罗小黑系列中价值观的包容性 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2564">42:44</a></span><br><span>恩野也很喜欢罗小黑的配乐 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2692">44:52</a></span><br><span>——————————</span><br><span>朋友送的新婚礼物珐琅锅</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo106PYwJQGJ0fVJJZbgc7odE5Dv.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>强推汕头海记猪血汤</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqXNxt1u-HY2mx_8an0qNZ8Eu-P6.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>中秋恩野烤出人生鸡腿</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkuFuepWZCOunQpdfAvbetKSwZQv.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/62ca620653bb1ec4bdfa9a68/ljqo2jTqDsdgVxCZWVCVWXK8JGX5.m4a" length="44065671" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:45:24</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv1e7y3gF_R4UdECElHekwV4x24A.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
